IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `qla-dates`
IMPORT `qla-rules`
IMPORT `qla-seat`

-- Limitation of Actions Act 1974 (Qld) -- worked cases for the claimant's questions (qla-seat.l4), the date helpers
-- (qla-dates.l4) and the time bar (qla-rules.l4). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text; none
-- was copied from the encoding's output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law.
-- The facts are illustrative.
-- UNOFFICIAL. Based on content from the Queensland Legislation website at 6 November 2026 (c) The State of Queensland,
-- CC BY 4.0. BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the calendar date`
`nd` MEANS `d` 1 1 2000
`adult born` MEANS `d` 1 1 1970
`me` MEANS `it first accrued to me`

GIVEN `y` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`last day` `y` MEANS `the last day to commence is` `y`

§§ `Dates`

-- F1: from 29 February into a year without one, 28 February; into a leap year, 29 February.
#ASSERT `the anniversary` 1 `years after` (`d` 29 2 2024) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2025
#ASSERT `the anniversary` 4 `years after` (`d` 29 2 2024) EQUALS `d` 29 2 2028
#ASSERT `the date` 56 `days after` (`d` 1 3 2025) EQUALS `d` 26 4 2025

§§ `Where I stand: s 5(2), (3)`

#ASSERT `Am I under a disability` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I under a disability` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I under a disability` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I under a disability` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I under a disability` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Am I under a disability` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `Child abuse: s 11A`

#ASSERT `Can I bring my child abuse claim at any time` TRUE `sexual abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I bring my child abuse claim at any time` TRUE `serious physical abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I bring my child abuse claim at any time` TRUE `psychological abuse in connection with sexual abuse or serious physical abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "abuse ... means": other harm is not abuse.
#ASSERT `Can I bring my child abuse claim at any time` TRUE `other abuse or harm` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Abused as an adult, or not a damages claim for injury: outside the grant (s 11 governs).
#ASSERT `Can I bring my child abuse claim at any time` TRUE `sexual abuse` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can I bring my child abuse claim at any time` FALSE `sexual abuse` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Child abuse: s 48`

#ASSERT `Can I sue on my earlier child abuse claim` TRUE `nothing: it was never barred, sued on or settled` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I sue on my earlier child abuse claim` TRUE `it was out of time, or an action on it was dismissed, discontinued or decided because it was out of time` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I sue on my earlier child abuse claim` TRUE `I settled it after a limitation period had expired` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I sue on my earlier child abuse claim` TRUE `I settled it after a limitation period had expired` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Finding 6: a settlement within time is not a "previously settled right of action".
#ASSERT `Can I sue on my earlier child abuse claim` TRUE `I settled it before any limitation period had expired` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Can I sue on my earlier child abuse claim` FALSE `nothing: it was never barred, sued on or settled` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Dust-related conditions: s 11(2), (3), s 47`

#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- F5: the s 47(2) exceptions read as reaching only rights that accrued before s 47 commenced.
#ASSERT `Is my dust disease claim free of any time limit` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `Personal injury and death: the time limit`

-- An adult with no disability, fraud or order.
GIVEN `abuse` IS A BOOLEAN, `dust` IS A BOOLEAN, `other Act` IS A BOOLEAN, `arose` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`injury limit` `abuse` `dust` `other Act` `arose` MEANS
    `By when must I start my personal injury or death action` `abuse` `dust` `other Act` `arose` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd`

GIVEN `arose` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`plain injury limit` `arose` MEANS `injury limit` FALSE FALSE FALSE `arose`

GIVEN `arose` IS A DATE, `how` IS A `How the right came to me`, `born` IS A DATE, `unsound` IS A BOOLEAN, `ended` IS A BOOLEAN, `end` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`disabled injury limit` `arose` `how` `born` `unsound` `ended` `end` MEANS
    `By when must I start my personal injury or death action` FALSE FALSE FALSE `arose` `how` `born` `unsound` `ended` `end` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd`

GIVEN `arose` IS A DATE, `start` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`plain injury in time` `arose` `start` MEANS
    `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE FALSE `arose` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` `start`

-- s 11(1): 3 years from the day the cause of action arose; the last day and the day after.
#ASSERT `plain injury limit` (`d` 10 3 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 10 3 2023)
#ASSERT `plain injury in time` (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 10 3 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `plain injury in time` (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 11 3 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `plain injury in time` (`d` 10 3 2020) (`d` 1 6 2021) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- From 29 February (F1).
#ASSERT `plain injury limit` (`d` 29 2 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 28 2 2023)
#ASSERT `plain injury in time` (`d` 29 2 2020) (`d` 1 3 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 11A, s 11(2): no period, even under another Act; s 7: another Act's period.
#ASSERT `injury limit` TRUE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 1980) EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `injury limit` TRUE FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 1 1980) EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `injury limit` FALSE TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 1980) EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `injury limit` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2020) EQUALS `another Act's time limit applies`
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` TRUE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 1980) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` (`d` 1 1 2060) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` (`d` 1 6 2020) EQUALS NOTHING

-- s 29(1), (2)(c): an infant at accrual -- 3 years from the 18th birthday (15 June 2023), so 15 June 2026.
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 1 2015) `me` (`d` 15 6 2005) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 15 6 2026)
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2015) `me` (`d` 15 6 2005) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` (`d` 15 6 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2015) `me` (`d` 15 6 2005) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` (`d` 16 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Injured the day before the 18th birthday (an infant): 15 June 2026, a day more than the 14 June 2026 of s 11(1).
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 14 6 2023) `me` (`d` 15 6 2005) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 15 6 2026)
-- Injured on the 18th birthday (no longer an infant): s 11(1) only.
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 15 6 2023) `me` (`d` 15 6 2005) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 15 6 2026)
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 16 6 2023) `me` (`d` 15 6 2005) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 16 6 2026)
-- Of unsound mind at accrual, not ended: no last day yet; ended 1 July 2024: 1 July 2027.
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` TRUE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `no last day yet, because the disability has not ended`
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` TRUE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` (`d` 1 1 2040) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 7 2024) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2027)
-- Unsound mind that ended a month after accrual still gives the later day: 1 February 2023, not 1 January 2023.
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 2 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 2 2023)
-- An infant also of unsound mind (F4): disability lasts until both end.
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 1 2015) `me` (`d` 1 1 2010) TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 1 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2031)
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 1 2015) `me` (`d` 1 1 2010) TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 6 2030) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2033)
-- s 29(3)(a): first accrued to an adult through whom the infant claims -- no extension.
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 3 2015) `it first accrued to a person not under a disability, through whom I claim` (`d` 1 1 2010) FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2018)
-- s 29(2)(a): passed on the death (5 May 2021) of a person under a disability: 3 years from that death.
#ASSERT `disabled injury limit` (`d` 1 1 2019) `it passed to me on the death of the person to whom it accrued, who was under a disability then and when it accrued` `adult born` FALSE FALSE (`d` 5 5 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 5 5 2024)

-- s 38: fraud not yet discovered; discovered 1 June 2022.
#ASSERT `By when must I start my personal injury or death action` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `time has not yet begun to count`
#ASSERT `By when must I start my personal injury or death action` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 6 2022) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 6 2025)
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` (`d` 1 1 2035) EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- s 31 order: fact within means of knowledge on 1 December 2022 -- 1 December 2023; an order on an earlier fact day does
-- not shorten the period.
#ASSERT `By when must I start my personal injury or death action` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 12 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 12 2023)
#ASSERT `By when must I start my personal injury or death action` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2023)
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 12 2022) (`d` 1 12 2023) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I still start my personal injury or death action on this day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2020) `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 12 2022) (`d` 2 12 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `Late-discovered facts: ss 30-32`

-- Period ends 1 March 2023; its last year begins 2 March 2022 (F7).
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time for a fact I learned late` (`d` 1 3 2023) (`d` 2 3 2022) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time for a fact I learned late` (`d` 1 3 2023) (`d` 1 3 2022) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Learned after the period expired: s 31(3) lets the application be made.
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time for a fact I learned late` (`d` 1 3 2023) (`d` 1 6 2023) TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time for a fact I learned late` (`d` 1 3 2023) (`d` 1 6 2023) FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can the court extend my time for a fact I learned late` (`d` 1 3 2023) (`d` 1 6 2023) TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `Acknowledgement and part payment: ss 35(3), 36`

#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE FALSE `a written acknowledgement signed by the person liable or their agent` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE FALSE `an acknowledgement not in writing, or not signed` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE FALSE `a payment of principal or interest` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE FALSE `a payment of principal or interest` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` TRUE FALSE `no acknowledgement or payment` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` FALSE FALSE `a written acknowledgement signed by the person liable or their agent` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Did their acknowledgement or payment restart my time` FALSE TRUE `a written acknowledgement signed by the person liable or their agent` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

§§ `Other claims: the time limit`

`contract` MEANS `a claim in contract, quasi-contract or tort, other than for personal injury or defamation`
`none` MEANS `no acknowledgement or payment`

-- An adult, no special facts.
GIVEN `kind` IS A `Kind of claim`, `arose` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`claim limit` `kind` `arose` MEANS
    `By when must I start my action` `kind` FALSE `arose` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd`

GIVEN `kind` IS A `Kind of claim`, `arose` IS A DATE, `start` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`claim in time` `kind` `arose` `start` MEANS
    `Can I still start my action on this day` `kind` FALSE `arose` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` `start`

-- A debt with an acknowledgement or payment.
GIVEN `liquidated` IS A BOOLEAN, `what` IS A `Kind of acknowledgement`, `to me` IS A BOOLEAN, `on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`debt limit` `liquidated` `what` `to me` `on` MEANS
    `By when must I start my action` `contract` FALSE (`d` 1 7 2015) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` `liquidated` `what` `to me` `on` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd`

-- A beneficiary's claim with a future interest.
GIVEN `future` IS A BOOLEAN, `fallen` IS A BOOLEAN, `on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`trust limit` `future` `fallen` `on` MEANS
    `By when must I start my action` `a beneficiary's other claim for trust property or breach of trust` FALSE (`d` 1 1 2018) FALSE FALSE `future` `fallen` `on` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd`

-- s 10(1)(a): 6 years; the last day and the day after.
#ASSERT `claim limit` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2025)
#ASSERT `claim in time` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 1 7 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `claim in time` `contract` (`d` 1 7 2019) (`d` 2 7 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim to enforce a recognisance or an award` (`d` 3 3 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 3 3 2026)
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim for a sum recoverable under an enactment, other than a penalty or forfeiture` (`d` 3 3 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 3 3 2026)
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim for an account` (`d` 3 3 2020) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 3 3 2026)
-- s 10(4): a judgment, 12 years from when it became enforceable.
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim on a judgment` (`d` 3 2 2010) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 3 2 2022)
-- s 28: an estate share 12 years; arrears of interest on a legacy 6 years.
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim to a deceased person's personal estate or a share in it` (`d` 1 5 2014) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 5 2026)
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim for arrears of interest on a legacy` (`d` 1 5 2014) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 5 2020)
-- s 27(1): no period; s 27(2): 6 years; s 27(2A): a future interest.
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a beneficiary's claim against a trustee for fraud, or for trust property the trustee holds or converted` (`d` 1 1 1990) EQUALS `no limitation period applies`
#ASSERT `trust limit` FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2024)
#ASSERT `trust limit` TRUE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `time has not yet begun to count`
#ASSERT `trust limit` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 8 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 8 2028)
-- s 10(3) and s 51: a deed made after the 2023 amendment, 6 years; an earlier deed, not answered.
#ASSERT `By when must I start my action` `a claim on a deed` FALSE (`d` 1 9 2025) TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 9 2031)
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim on a deed` (`d` 1 9 2020) EQUALS `not answered by this encoding`
#ASSERT `claim in time` `a claim on a deed` (`d` 1 9 2020) (`d` 1 9 2021) EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 10A: 1 year after payment, despite another Act and with no extension for disability; an overpayment anyway: not answered.
#ASSERT `claim limit` `a claim to recover money paid as a tax under an invalid Act or provision` (`d` 30 6 2025) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 30 6 2026)
#ASSERT `claim in time` `a claim to recover money paid as a tax under an invalid Act or provision` (`d` 30 6 2025) (`d` 1 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `By when must I start my action` `a claim to recover money paid as a tax under an invalid Act or provision` TRUE (`d` 30 6 2025) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` (`d` 1 1 2010) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 30 6 2026)
#ASSERT `By when must I start my action` `a claim to recover money paid as a tax under an invalid Act or provision` FALSE (`d` 30 6 2025) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `not answered by this encoding`
-- s 7 and outside the encoding.
#ASSERT `By when must I start my action` `contract` TRUE (`d` 1 7 2019) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `another Act's time limit applies`
#ASSERT `claim limit` `another kind of claim` (`d` 1 7 2019) EQUALS `not answered by this encoding`
