#ASSERT `debt limit` TRUE `a payment of principal or interest` FALSE (`d` 10 10 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2021)
#ASSERT `debt limit` FALSE `a written acknowledgement signed by the person liable or their agent` TRUE (`d` 10 10 2022) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2021)
-- s 29(1): an infant (born 1 March 2005) whose contract claim arose 1 March 2020: 6 years from the 18th birthday.
#ASSERT `By when must I start my action` `contract` FALSE (`d` 1 3 2020) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` (`d` 1 3 2005) FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2029)
-- s 38: fraud discovered 1 September 2021; not yet discovered.
#ASSERT `By when must I start my action` `contract` FALSE (`d` 1 1 2019) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE TRUE (`d` 1 9 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 9 2027)
#ASSERT `By when must I start my action` `contract` FALSE (`d` 1 1 2019) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `nd` FALSE `none` FALSE `nd` `me` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` TRUE FALSE `nd` EQUALS `time has not yet begun to count`

§§ `Defamation`

GIVEN `pub` IS A DATE, `notice` IS A BOOLEAN, `nday` IS A DATE, `ext` IS A BOOLEAN, `eday` IS A DATE
GIVETH A `Time limit`
`defamation limit` `pub` `notice` `nday` `ext` `eday` MEANS
    `By when must I start my defamation action` `pub` TRUE `notice` `nday` `ext` `eday` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd`

-- s 10AB.
#ASSERT `From what day does my defamation time run` (`d` 1 3 2024) FALSE `nd` FALSE EQUALS `d` 1 3 2024
#ASSERT `From what day does my defamation time run` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`d` 1 9 2023) FALSE EQUALS `d` 1 9 2023
#ASSERT `From what day does my defamation time run` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`d` 1 9 2023) TRUE EQUALS `d` 1 3 2024
-- s 10AA(1): 1 year; the last day and the day after.
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2025)
#ASSERT `Can I still start my defamation action on this day` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` (`d` 1 3 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I still start my defamation action on this day` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE FALSE `nd` FALSE `nd` `adult born` FALSE FALSE `nd` (`d` 2 3 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 10AA(2), (3): notice on the last day (56 more days); 6 days before it (the section's example: 50 more days); at the
-- start of the window (5 January 2025) and the day before it (F10).
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`d` 1 3 2025) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 26 4 2025)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`d` 23 2 2025) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 20 4 2025)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`d` 5 1 2025) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 2 3 2025)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`d` 4 1 2025) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2025)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) TRUE (`d` 2 3 2025) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2025)
-- s 32A: a court extension, capped at 3 years from publication.
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 12 2025) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 12 2025)
#ASSERT `defamation limit` (`d` 1 3 2024) FALSE `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 6 2027) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 3 2027)
