§§ `Answering a claim: ss 40, 42`

#ASSERT `By when must I claim contribution` `by a judgment or an arbitral award` (`d` 1 7 2024) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2023) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2026)
#ASSERT `By when must I claim contribution` `by an agreement with the person who had the claim, fixing the amount` (`d` 1 7 2024) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2021) EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 1 2025)
#ASSERT `By when must I claim contribution` `by a judgment or an arbitral award` (`d` 1 7 2024) FALSE `nd` EQUALS `last day` (`d` 1 7 2026)
#ASSERT `By when must I claim contribution` `not yet fixed by a judgment, award or agreement` `nd` TRUE (`d` 1 1 2023) EQUALS `not answered by this encoding`
#ASSERT `On what day is my counterclaim taken to have started` (`d` 5 5 2025) EQUALS `d` 5 5 2025
